-055-pan-ni:p001:m0007","surface":"正叔","start":7,"end":9,"person_id":"54l_hzh_um4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-ni:p001:m0011","surface":"勖","start":11,"end":12,"person_id":"5wd_bti_0bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-ni:p001:m0019","surface":"滿","start":19,"end":20,"person_id":"vpu_ikf_hdu","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-ni:p001:m0032","surface":"尼","start":32,"end":33,"person_id":"54l_hzh_um4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-ni:p001:m0039","surface":"岳","start":39,"end":40,"person_id":"d2b_1d3_333","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-ni","book_id":"b-jinshu-055","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-055-pan-ni-ws2316433"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-ni:p018","text":"尼以為王者膺受命之期，當神器之運，總萬機而撫四海，簡群才而審所授，孜孜於得人，汲汲于聞過，雖廷爭面折，猶將祈請而求焉。至於箴規，諫之順者，曷為獨闕之哉？是以不量其學陋思淺，因負擔之餘，嘗試撰而述之。不敢斥至尊之號，故以「乘輿」目篇。蓋帝王之事至大，而古今之變至眾，文繁而義詭，意局而辭野，將欲希企前賢，仿佛崇軌，譬猶丘坻之望華岱，恆星之系日月也，其不逮明矣。頌曰：","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":135,"last_line":135,"raw_start":12132,"raw_end":12314,"raw_character_offsets":[12132,12133,12134,12135,12136,12137,12138,12139,12140,12141,12142,12143,12144,12145,12146,12147,12148,12149,12150,12151,12152,12153,12154,12155,12156,12157,12158,12159,12160,12161,12162,12163,12164,12165,12166,12167,12168,12169,12170,12171,12172,12173,12174,12175,12176,12177,12178,12179,12180,12181,12182,12183,12184,12185,12186,12187,12188,12189,12190,12191,12192,12193,12194,12195,12196,12197,12198,12199,12200,12201,12202,12203,12204,12205,12206,12207,12208,12209,12210,12211,12212,12213,12214,12215,12216,12217,12218,12219,12220,12221,12222,12223,12224,12225,12226,12227,12228,12229,12230,12231,12232,12233,12234,12235,12236,12237,12238,12239,12240,12241,12242,12243,12244,12245,12246,12247,12248,12249,12250,12251,12252,12253,12254,12